or $c=-1$ is the plane $z=y-x.$" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318548 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318549 13194139534903 true] [17592186318548 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318550 13194139534903 true] [17592186318548 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318551 13194139534903 true] [17592186318548 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318552 13194139534903 true] [17592186318548 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318553 13194139534903 true] [17592186318548 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534903 true] [17592186318548 1041 "selection" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318548 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318549 13194139534903 true] [17592186318548 1110 #uuid "df24c305-ab2b-5f19-9ab0-d5f020dbdd4c" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318549 1034 "z=y-x" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318549 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534903 true] [17592186318549 1111 #uuid "557840b2-1c87-5581-b70e-c674e75cdfba" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318550 1034 "z=x-y" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318550 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534903 true] [17592186318550 1111 #uuid "9f567d29-a97c-59ba-8814-3e87ae2cf680" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318551 1034 "z=x+y" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318551 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534903 true] [17592186318551 1111 #uuid "e7dfe23a-f83b-5846-96e4-4e0f41451d15" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318552 1034 "z=\\frac{1}{x+y}" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318552 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534903 true] [17592186318552 1111 #uuid "c18af71a-e98a-597c-8338-7bc77fbabff3" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318553 1034 "z=\\frac{1}{x-y}" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318553 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534903 true] [17592186318553 1111 #uuid "1833156f-bc74-5510-8e51-c5f6d5fde277" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318554 1017 #edb/ref 17592186318555 13194139534903 true] [17592186318554 1089 "q-129186" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318554 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534903 true] [17592186318554 1100 "For the function $f(x,y,z)={e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-z-1},$ find the equation of the level surface $f(x,y,z)=1.$" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318554 1113 #uuid "ddedfa04-1151-5ff0-acc7-8b052f184f33" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318554 1145 "The level surfaces for the function $f(x,y,z)$ are given by the equation\n\n$$\nf(x,y,z)=c.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we're interested in $c=1.$ So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y,z) & =c \\\\ {e}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-z-1} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-z-1 & =0 \\\\ z & ={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the level surface for $c=1$ is the paraboloid $z={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-1.$" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318556 13194139534903 true] [17592186318555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318557 13194139534903 true] [17592186318555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318558 13194139534903 true] [17592186318555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318559 13194139534903 true] [17592186318555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318560 13194139534903 true] [17592186318555 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534903 true] [17592186318555 1041 "selection" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318555 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318556 13194139534903 true] [17592186318555 1110 #uuid "a41c64a5-e812-55ef-81a3-7f3e1c56ec62" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318556 1034 "z={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-1" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318556 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534903 true] [17592186318556 1111 #uuid "722e9fe7-52bc-58f5-a99d-17088447b4e8" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318557 1034 "z=-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-2" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318557 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534903 true] [17592186318557 1111 #uuid "fc212aa1-2b52-5605-b31a-ec992818c6f6" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318558 1034 "z=-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}+1" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318558 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534903 true] [17592186318558 1111 #uuid "7c128848-f51f-5ecd-9bd3-fb25e4f53f02" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318559 1034 "z={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-2" 13194139534903 true] [17592186318559 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534903 true] [17592186318559 1111 #uuid "d1ff482a-31ae-5c8b-97fc-d67346a38098" 13